WEBVTT

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.150
Ouch...

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.150
Where am I?

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.450
I smell animals.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.830
There's something there.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.210
That's right, my legendary beasts.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.970
You all know very well
what's behind these doors.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.510
This is where the beasts
that weren't chosen are cast away.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:42.730
Now, time for the wild beast show.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:58.450
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.660
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:07.880
All I want is to be with those I love

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:14.090
Ready or not
Here I come

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.100
I don't care anymore

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:19.810
I just don't know anymore

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:23.390
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.520
There are days when I think like that

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:29.110
But everything is precious to me

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:32.360
And so I fight on

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:35.820
Today was a tough day

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:38.870
I almost gave up hope

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:44.870
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:48.420
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.920
There are days when I think like that

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.550
But everything is precious to me

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:57.590
And so I must fight

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:16.820
#26 Animal show

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.210
They're all dead!

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.670
Pretty much, but not exactly.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.090
They're sleeping.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.840
In a special antioxidant solution.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.970
Floating in safety.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:44.100
This is where the original bodies
of the android-Os are kept.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:49.400
They go out doing whatever they want,
hiding their real bodies here.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.860
If their mechanical bodies break,

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:57.530
their memories are downloaded
from here into a new body.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:02.620
So these bodies are very precious to them.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.000
But that means there are always
two of them in this world.

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.500
So weird.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.630
That's why I hate them.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.840
I like how I'm the only me.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.060
I feel the same way.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:33.810
And they go around
making other people suffer.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.780
While they float here in safety.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.400
I won't let them continue.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.700
Whoa, what do you want?

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.830
We agreed on something. I'm glad.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.620
-What are you talking about?
-Found them!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.000
Oh dear. What now, Masaru?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.840
I'll fight.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.270
Hear that?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.520
The terrified cry
of someone about to die.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.070
The monster from the Greek myths, Gorgon.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.070
The great winged snake, Basilisk.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.950
The single-horned beast, Unicorn.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.830
The guardian of hell, Cerberus.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:37.590
I created those creatures myself.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:42.550
But they were too wild to tame. A failure.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.800
That little girl won't last a minute
in there.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.060
What do you want?

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.360
Did you enjoy talking with
Les Derniers Quatre?

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.190
No.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.570
I see.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.990
Anyway, have a seat.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.250
Then how's this for entertainment?

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.170
Do you think I still have
something to fear?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.680
We'll see after you watch the show
I've prepared for you.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.510
Lise!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.180
That's not all.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.020
Mr. Masaru!

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.770
Those brats are about to be killed.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.280
Make them stop!
What else do you want from me?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.990
I won't disobey you anymore. So help them!

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.990
Please, Faceless!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.540
What I want, you ask?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.040
I want your hatred.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.670
Do you know who you are?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:07.300
You're the reincarnation
of my one and only love.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:12.140
It was your destiny to be mine
ever since you were born.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.480
But look what you've gone and done.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:20.730
I let you free for just a second,
and you get friendly with some bastard.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.780
You get feelings for him.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:27.570
And you start caring for some little punk
that can't wipe his own butt.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.830
You will not ridicule
Narumi and Mr. Masaru.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:40.330
What a mean man I am
for hitting a woman.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:45.090
But you're the one that made me like this.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:51.300
I don't need any half-hearted obedience
or love.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.060
The brats will die.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.850
So go on and hate me.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.560
Éléonore.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.360
I do.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.570
I hate you.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.320
Yes, that's the spirit.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:17.370
After I become Masaru,
I'll fight this old body of mine.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.750
And you won't be able to doubt me anymore.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:27.550
You'll know it could be a download, but
your hatred for Faceless will be stronger.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:32.430
You will love me forever as Masaru.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.350
I'm scared... I'm scared...

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:41.850
Mom... Sis...

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.070
Even when I first went into a lion's cage.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.820
Even when I first trained a tiger.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.990
Nothing was as scary as this.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.700
I'm not ready for this...

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:59.080
I've never trained
such ferocious animals before.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.080
Those fangs will chew my flesh.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.840
Those claws will slash my throat.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.840
That horn will pierce my gut.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.350
And those eyes will make my heart fail.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.850
I'm going to die.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.890
Just like Sis.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.360
Eaten by beasts...!

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.860
But I want to see you perform.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:35.620
My performance?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:40.120
Yeah. What's the one thing
you want to do the most?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.330
Be in a circus.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.380
That's right.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.800
I came here to help Masaru.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.890
I'm a wild beast tamer.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:06.400
What better way for me to die
than to be eaten by beasts?

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.450
Step back!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.950
Leave this room immediately.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.950
Or I will kill you.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.540
Kill him? Are we allowed to?

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.750
Shut up, she's bluffing.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.300
Seems like Naya is really mad
for some reason.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:34.340
I'll hold them off,
so you make a run for it.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.720
-No.
-Huh?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.220
You can't beat all those Os.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.020
You never know until you try.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.610
Suit yourself. Then die!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.900
-You little...
-Dismantle!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.910
Wow.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.200
What are you doing?
Surround him and subdue him!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.700
Let me in too! Count me in.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.830
Come here, my bugs.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:17.090
Let's see what's left
of that poor little girl.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.400
Dr. Lao.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.110
What... No...

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.860
Your children wish to say hello to you.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.570
Impossible.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:41.620
Not even I could control
those savage beasts.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.870
But you could? You tamed them?

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:52.630
On behalf of all wild beast tamers
working in circuses,

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.510
I will never forgive you.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.880
Ready? Go!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:03.260
Kill that human
and those treacherous creatures!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.070
Oh dear, the Os are acting strange.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:23.120
Colombine!

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.660
Those electromagnetic waves
upset synthetic body fluids.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.420
Now, time to tear you to pieces.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.250
What's so funny?

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:39.680
We were here long before you.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.430
Did you think we sat here doing nothing?

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:44.890
What...?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.140
Body temperature, 37 degrees.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.190
Pressure normalized.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.980
Opening the incubation capsules.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.280
Our bodies are waking up.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.450
They're supposed to stay preserved!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.790
You little bastards!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.710
You're not safe anymore.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.800
My... my legendary beasts...

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.180
Impossible...

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:31.770
Stop! You made your animals fight,
but you're going to run?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.270
You coward!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.520
The same goes for you!

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.780
You're so kind. But I'll be fine.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:53.540
We circus entertainers need you animals
and an audience for us to live.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.790
So please, go faster.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.920
I'm going to defeat the automata
and run a circus again.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:07.510
Why is it that a human
could tame those beasts?

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:14.270
Because you used the brains
of real animals to make them.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:18.690
And because I gave my life to the animals.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.780
Because I'm a real wild beast tamer!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.960
Why are they all crying?

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:43.760
No clue.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.840
Might just be a reflex.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.430
Maybe they didn't want to wake up
to this world.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.690
No, stay asleep! You won't age in there.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.400
Here, get back in.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.530
I just killed myself!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:07.070
I... I killed myself...

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.120
Get back in. I'll preserve you.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.790
What the heck!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.630
Why not? My body is dead, too.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.750
You idiot!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.590
What in the world...

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:29.180
Why am I crystallizing
the second I woke up?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.430
No, I don't want me to die!

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.940
Stay back. No, stay back...

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.150
Why are you coming at me?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.650
I'm you. Stand back.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.160
You're me. I'm...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.030
I'm...

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.080
I-I am...

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.790
Who am I?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.920
They're all panicking
just from meeting themselves.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.550
And those Os seemed so fearless.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:14.060
They can't bear to see
how ugly they look old.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.810
But all humans grow old and die.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.980
And they think that's ugly.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.190
That's why they locked them up here.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.150
I don't think all humans are like that.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.700
But those guys are stupid for sure.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.870
Yay, we agree again.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:47.130
I can't move yet,
but you go on to Lady Francine...

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.970
I mean, Éléonore. Go save her.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:53.220
You're really going to save me?

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.600
What, you still didn't trust me?

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:01.980
But aren't I a bit better
than those Os down there?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.820
There are stairs past that door.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.900
Go up them.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.070
Thanks, Colombine.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.580
Don't look at me, Masaru Saiga!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.080
Don't look, damn it.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.580
That's right. This is me.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.960
Automata killed my family in Clogue.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:31.970
I lived for revenge for a long time
as a shirogane.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.970
This body experienced no happiness!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:42.640
I wanted to forget about this body.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.480
But you...

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.230
You made me remember it all!

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:50.360
D-Dismantle!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.750
You're right.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:10.260
After several experiments,
I transplanted Beast's brain into him.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:16.220
I heard that there was
a vicious man-eating tiger in the circus.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.760
So I stole it.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:23.020
My sister was killed by that tiger.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.940
I see.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:34.650
So Beast killed your sister.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.950
And Beast lost to me.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:42.080
Yet I've lost completely to you.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.710
How strange.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.930
I didn't come here to avenge my sister.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:59.350
But I feel like a cloud has lifted.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:02.890
Let's go.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:07.440
If we work together,
Masaru will be able to save Shirogane.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.990
I didn't want you of all people to see.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:18.120
You grew up in peace,
with all the time you could want.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:21.370
And now you laugh at my real body.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:24.700
-I'll kill you!
-I'm not laughing.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:30.790
Your family was killed by automata.
Why did you side with Faceless?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.630
I became a shirogane for revenge.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:40.140
But as I fought, I became scared of death.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:44.060
Even shiroganes age once every 5 years.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.350
And each time, I would wish.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.610
That I could relive a different life.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:54.820
That's when...

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:57.570
Lord Faceless came to me.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.780
Naya.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:05.370
All those fun things
you were deprived of doing.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.870
Why don't you do them
in an immortal body?

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.300
Just pledge your obedience to me.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:17.920
And I'll give you a new body
that will revive eternally.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:22.720
Why can't I do what I want to?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:28.560
All humans are equal, right?
Then I have my right to be happy too.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.560
I've suffered ever since I got ZONAPHA.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:37.990
So instead of all those people
who know nothing, now it's my turn.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:40.490
It's my turn to become happy!

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.380
No, you can't.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:06.140
You can't trample over other people
for your own happiness.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.770
I can't...?

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:13.690
You made a mistake in choosing
how to become happy.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.320
What do you mean?

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:19.820
Who cares about other people?
It's my happiness.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.200
Stop, Masaru Saiga.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.280
What do you know, you brat!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.080
My fluids... It won't stop.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.290
I have to return to my body.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.580
No, not that body...

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:45.970
Why have I become so ugly?

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:52.310
I thought I wouldn't age
if I was preserved.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:57.980
Or did Lord Faceless trick me?

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.860
No, I don't want to return to that body.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.500
I don't want to die!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.960
Poor Naya.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.970
I'm scared of dying, too.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.140
But...

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:29.510
I'm going to live in this body
until I die!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:33.310
And I'll save Shirogane.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.020
Mr. Masaru!

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:44.610
Faceless!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.990
Live till you die, eh?

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.290
Well then...

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.370
I guess it's time for you to die.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.090
Narumi.

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.130
I had no idea then,

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:10.140
that Faceless had
a horrifying plan up his sleeve.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.150
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:29.950
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:34.620
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:39.540
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:44.380
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:48.930
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:53.680
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:58.690
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:03.400
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:08.030
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.660
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:12.830 --> 00:23:17.410
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:22.540
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:30.340
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:34.390
The melody that brought you here
